      "text": "​Ma’lum bo‘lishicha, PlayStation 5 konsoli uchun tayyorlanayotgan o‘yinlar. IGN sayti e’lon qilgan ro‘yxatda ularning soni oltmishtadan ham oshiq!\n\nUlarning naq o‘ntasi faqat PlayStation 5 uchun eksklyuziv o‘yinlar, boshqa pristavkalarga va kompyuterlarga umuman chiqmaydi. Ikkitasi esa vaqtinchalik eksklyuziv, ya’ni dastlab PlayStation 5 uchun taqdim etilib, ma’lum muddatdan so‘ng boshqa platformalar uchun ham chiqariladi. Uchinchi guruhdagilar esa PS 5 uchun ham, boshqa o‘yin konsollari yoki kompyuterlarga ham taqdim qilinadi.\n\nEksklyuziv o‘yinlar:\n- Astro's Playroom (SIE Japan Studios)\n- Demon's Souls (Bluepoint and Japan Studio)\n- Destruction AllStars (Lucid)\n- Gran Turismo 7 (Polyphony Digital)\n- Horizon 2 Forbidden West (Guerrilla Games)\n- Project Athia (Square Enix / Luminous Production) – 2023 yilda\n- Ratchet and Clank: Rift Apart (Insomniac Games)\n- Returnal (Housemarque)\n- Sackboy: A Big Adventure (Sumo Digital)\n- Spider-Man: Miles Morales (Insomniac Games) – 2020 yil oxirida\n\nVaqtinchalik eksklyuzivlar:\n- Death Loop (Bethesda Softworks / Arkane Studios)\n- Ghostwire Tokyo (Tango Gameworks) – 2021 yilda\n\nQolgan o‘yinlar:\n- Assassin's Creed Valhalla (Ubisoft) – 2020 yil oxirida\n- Battlefield 6 (EA) – 2021 yilda\n- Bugsnax (Young Horses) – 2020 yil oxirida\n- Chivalry 2 (Torn Banner Studios) – 2020 yilda\n- Chorus (Deep Silver) – 2021 yilda\n- Control (Remedy)\n- Cygni: All Guns Blazing (Keel Works)\n- Destiny 2 (Bungie)\n- DiRT 5 (Codemasters) – 2020 yil oktyabrda\n- Dying Light 2 (Techland)\n- Fortnite (Epic Games) – taqdim etilishi bilan\n- Godfall (Gearbox) – 2020 yil dekabrda\n- Gods and Monsters (Ubisoft) – 2020 yil oxirida\n- Goodbye Volcano High (Ko_oP) – 2021 yilda\n- Gothic Remake (THQ Nordic)\n- GTA 5 (Rockstar Games) – 2021 yilda\n- Hitman III (IO Interactive) – 2021 yil yanvarda\n- Jett: The Far Shore (Superbrothers) – 2020 yil oxirida\n- Kena: Bridge of Spirits (Ember Lab)\n- Little Devil Inside (Neostream Interactive)\n- Madden NFL 21 (EA) – 2020 yilda\n- MicroMan (Glob Games Studio) – 2021 yilda\n- Metal Hellsinger (The Outsiders) – 2021 yilda\n- Moonray (Everything is Full of Gods) – 2021 yilda\n- NBA 2K21 (Visual Concepts) – 2020 yil kuzda\n- Nth^0 Infinity Reborn (KITATUS) – 2021 yilda\n- Observer (System Redux) (Bloober Team) – 2020 yil oxirida\n- Oddworld Soulstorm (Oddworld Inhabitants) – 2020 yilda\n- Outriders (Square Enix) 2020 yil oxirida\n- Pragmata (Capcom) – 2022 yilda\n- Psyhotel (Ultimate Games)\n- Quantum Error (Teamkill Media) – 2020 yilda\n- Rainbow Six Quarantine (Ubisoft) – 2020-2021 yilda\n- Rainbow Six Siege (Ubisoft) – taqdim etilishi bilan\n- Redo! Enhanced Edition (Robson Pavia) – 2020 yilda\n- Resident Evil VIII: Village (Capcom) – 2021 yilda\n- Scarlet Nexus (Bandai Namco)\n- Solar Ash (Heart Machine) – 2021 yilda\n- Soulborn (Pixelmad Studios) – 2021 yilda\n- Stray (BlueTwelve / Annapurna Interactive) – 2021 yilda\n- The Lord of the Rings: Gollum (Daedalic - Entertainment) – 2021 yilda\n- The Pathless (Giant Squid)\n- The Sims 5 (EA)\n- Tribes of Midgard (Norsfell) – 2021 yilda\n- Ultimate Fishing Simulator 2 (MasterCode) – 2020 yilda\n- Vampire: The Masquerade - Bloodlines 2 (Paradox) – 2020 yilda\n- Warframe (Digital Extremes)\n- Watch Dogs: Legion (Ubisoft) – 2020 yil oxirida\n- WRC 9 (Kylotonn) – 2020 yilda\n\nBularni orasida siz kutayotgan o'yin bormi",
